{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104140552278-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104143644\"/><p>救援人員趕至現場。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>長沙灣有人墮樓。今午(4日)1時44分，一名年約50歲男子從蘇屋邨百合樓一低層單位墮下，受傷倒臥大廈平台位置。救援人員接報到場將清醒事主救回地面，交救護車送院治理，其身份及墮樓原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:45:47.663278+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:05:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:49.418268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:49.418268+00:00","content_hash":"9c825f2ad3a59e4b5abc4edb46903b7516efcc9d7cad32aa19363644a11c2974","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}